+The 59-entry bounded artifact manifest box/g9966s8-20260903/artifact-manifest.sha256 has SHA-256 16e4569da5687a7eb88badbc7d27f76a9ea4b1fda8142afe87c152e17b3755fa. Every entry passed sha256sum -c; the retained check output has SHA-256 c036a70f5cfa0608818c2b85a31f802f120af2e650e26bb02e4427894c05ac17. The manifest excludes itself and its check output.
