+## 6. Stop rule and recomposition gate
+
+The branch died at the first newly requested band, so stage 9 was neither started nor emitted as a next-system manifest. Although the stage-8 JSON contains the engine's generic prospective next_stage description, the manifest helper has no license to serialize it after a DEAD result. There was no second unchanged dimension, no nonlinear surviving scheme, and no budget stop.
