+| runs/delta52/stage8.sing | emitted exact localized residue system | 36f7f21f9faa3f7fec6b1d9353a194c17c6aecb8d2a5c2e48096b680c6e77b2e |
+| validated-through-stage8.json | contiguous stage-0--8 ledger validation | f92336d610f7f70f3cdc188adb74b5244b984c1fe1e66237b03cfec1722b9bfb |
+| stage8-singular-replay.out | independent c-localized exact replay | 236517b4a8e5567c586d39194059d49207001416a1d922efaec1fc3d2b9c7b73 |
+| death-certificate.json | both rational membership witnesses and Singular controls | 0f6ce49429af87977d4a995b19b051145ac6232783d1adf4db80ecd8b00891b6 |
+
+The 59-entry bounded artifact manifest box/g9966s8-20260903/artifact-manifest.sha256 has SHA-256 e097c62e086dfe93912dc1422421b1a5ed9c3f0901feb72499d55aac24aa4f6b. Every entry passed sha256sum -c; the retained check output has SHA-256 c036a70f5cfa0608818c2b85a31f802f120af2e650e26bb02e4427894c05ac17. The manifest excludes itself and its check output.
+
+The new drivers are prepare_workspace.py, custody_replay.py, run_stage.sh, accept_stage.py, and build_death_certificate.py, all under box/g9966s8-20260903/. At completion there is no running band engine, timeout wrapper, Singular process, or later-stage job.
+
+## 10. Final verdict
+
+Stage 8 is the deepest and terminal accepted stage. The exact reduced constant 64 makes the delta=5/2 localized ideal [1]; the charged delta=2 branch is independently confirmed [1] from stage 4. Hence the declared (99,66) joint chart has no surviving branch. Subject exactly to the necessity, exhaustiveness, source, pole, and coordinate-map gates in section 7, there is no Keller pair with the (99,66) skeleton. Nothing here claims the unrestricted two-dimensional Jacobian conjecture.

