+The cumulative engine reconstructs all prior rows; it does not deserialize an elimination map from the 869-name file. Only proved nonzero rational coefficients are pivots, c is excluded, and the Q-star order is lexicographic symbol name. K2c is the charged computation basis; its full inverse to original C2,C3 names is not serialized.
