+| outer D1 | none; offset field is null, because the block was exhausted at rank 176 |
+| F pole rows | local power 16, pole exponent -173, two named coordinates |
+| G pole rows | local power 16, pole exponent -110, two named coordinates |
+| Jacobian | t-power 8, total degree 155, all w powers 0..155 (156 rows) |
