+## 4. Constant-unit certificate and Singular replay
+
+After all Q-star substitutions, the exact normal form of the named stage-8 pole row is the integer 64. There is no vanished leader or parameter division hidden in this step: the pivot ledger uses only the rational coefficients in the preceding table and excludes the localization parameter. Over Q, 64 is invertible, proving directly that the raw residue ideal and every localization of it are the unit ideal.
