+The three controls respectively confirm an empty localization, a nonempty point, and the raw unit ideal. The emitted file hash is 36f7f21f9faa3f7fec6b1d9353a194c17c6aecb8d2a5c2e48096b680c6e77b2e; the independent output hash is 236517b4a8e5567c586d39194059d49207001416a1d922efaec1fc3d2b9c7b73.
