+## 4. Constant-unit certificate and Singular replay
+
+After all Q-star substitutions, the exact normal form of the named stage-8 pole row is the integer 64. There is no vanished leader or parameter division hidden in this step: all 66 cumulative pivot coefficients are nonzero rationals, the seven new ones are tabulated above, and the localization parameter is excluded. Over Q, 64 is invertible, proving directly that the raw residue ideal and every localization of it are the unit ideal.
