+## 5. The other declared branch
+
+The current frozen delta=2 stage-4 JSON has the charged SHA-256 5e9dd9516335ef5afa0bd956d014cf8058050601ea960e284b6e5b0a6effef51. It records 118 constant residues after 35 cumulative Q-star pivots. The first one supplies the sufficient certificate
