+
+The original box/g9966band-20260903 ledger and accepted artifacts were not edited. The new run directory contains symlinks to the authenticated stage-0--7 artifact quartets and hard-linked copies of the newly generated stage-8 quartet. Validation output was written separately under box/g9966s8-20260903. No jc2-lean, ideation file, or excluded in-progress lane report was used.
