+The relevant charged scope and coordinate statements are in g9966-global-band-sol56-20260903.md:9-30,74-108,142-176,258-347,396-419 and g9966-outer-bridge-grok46-20260903.md:234-245,332-339. They do not themselves prove global chart necessity or branch exhaustiveness; those remain the declared conditions above.
